/// /tmp/swfdr_expected.txt): pi0(x) with logistic/linear fits and
/// unit.spline/smooth.spline smoothing, lm_qvalue (FDR/pFDR), the internal
/// bs unit-spline transformation matrix, and the calculateSwfdr EM algorithm
/// with rounded and truncated p-values.

